        "content": "## Inventory Matching\nPulls the full Google Sheets inventory, combines it with the AI-interpreted request, and asks a second AI agent to decide if the product exists — with a confidence score."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2dd4c427-732b-44b4-96c6-3d4c4b060280",
